      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANOTHER MEGHAN (1) failed to feature last start at this track, but prior to that won by 2.5 lengths at this track (23.54) beating Bonito in a Grade 5 on July 19. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from six starts. Ready to return to form. VANZANT HAYZE (2) produced a moderate performance last time when sixth at this track over 407m behind Untamed Velocity (24.18) in a Grade 4. Scored at her previous run. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Has ability and is one of the better chances. LEGENDS TOLD (4) flew the lids with a fast early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fourth (24.23) over 407m at this track. Warrants plenty of respect. MR. WILLIAMS (6) was on the bunny all the way to win last start. Will give a great sight.",
